sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant V as GUI / CLI
    participant F as MealPlanningFacade
    participant K as KitchenAssistant
    participant L as LLMClient
    participant T as AgentTool (e.g. expiring_items)
    participant S as PantryService / RecipeService
    U->>V: "What can I cook with food that expires soon?"
    V->>F: askAssistant(question) (via controller)
    F->>K: ask(question)
    K->>K: conversation = system prompt + tool list + memory + question
    loop up to 6 steps
        K->>L: complete(conversation)
        L-->>K: {"thought", "tool", "input"} or {"answer"}
        alt tool call
            K->>T: execute(input)
            T->>S: read-only query
            S-->>T: data
            T-->>K: observation text
            K->>K: append OBSERVATION to conversation
        else final answer
            K->>K: remember question and answer (bounded memory)
            K-->>F: AssistantReply(answer, toolCalls, trace)
        end
    end
    F-->>V: reply
    V-->>U: answer + tools used + agent steps
